### Needs a token from register/login. Seeded EXPENSE categories: 5 Food, 6 Transport, 7 Rent ...
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Create a R1000 Food budget for October 2026
POST http://localhost:8080/api/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":5,"budgetMonth":"2026-10-01","budgetAmount":1000.00}

### Same category + month again -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":5,"budgetMonth":"2026-10-15","budgetAmount":500.00}

### Spend R850 -> crosses 80%, creates a BUDGET_WARNING notification
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":5,"amount":850.00,"description":"Groceries","expenseDate":"2026-10-20"}

### Spend R200 more -> crosses 100%, creates a BUDGET_CRITICAL notification
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":5,"amount":200.00,"description":"Takeaway","expenseDate":"2026-10-22"}

### Budget progress (spent, remaining, percentUsed, status)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/budgets?month=2026-10-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notifications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
